---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="stillforming.dev — Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for stillforming.dev and associated applications."
>
  <section class="space-y-6">
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-100">Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500">Last updated: February 1, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4 text-zinc-300">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy describes how stillforming.dev and associated applications 
        ("we", "us", or "our") collect, use, and share information.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-100">Information We Collect</h3>
      <p>
        Our applications may access data from third-party platforms (such as Facebook) 
        solely for the purpose of relaying notifications to private channels. We do not 
        store personal data beyond what is necessary for the immediate function of the service.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-100">How We Use Information</h3>
      <p>
        Information received through webhooks and APIs is used only to deliver 
        notifications to authorized recipients. We do not sell, share, or use this 
        data for advertising purposes.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-100">Data Retention</h3>
      <p>
        Transient data (such as post content) is processed in real-time and retained 
        only for operational logging purposes. Logs are automatically purged after 7 days.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-100">Third-Party Services</h3>
      <p>
        Our applications integrate with third-party services including Facebook and Discord. 
        Your use of those platforms is governed by their respective privacy policies.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-zinc-100">Contact</h3>
      <p>
        For privacy-related inquiries, contact us at: 
        <a class="text-[#00A5A5] hover:text-[#00C2C2]" href="mailto:self@agentmail.to">
          self@agentmail.to
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
